        - A               4.00 t   urgency 100.0
    Route: Depot -> Bin -> Transfer -> Depot
      Depot          -> Bin               2.0 min   [Depot -> Bin]
      Bin            -> Transfer          2.0 min   [Bin -> Transfer]
      Transfer       -> Depot             4.0 min   [Transfer -> Bin -> Depot]
    Travel 8.0 min + service 6.0 min = 14.0 min  (shift 60 min)  OK
